### FINAL EXPECTATION

Deliver a cohesive Aetheria V4 world simulation and narrative expansion.

Do not merely create disconnected features. Make systems communicate with one another.

NPCs should react to world events. Quests should respond to faction activity. Factions should influence settlements. The economy should react to regional conditions. Player decisions should create persistent consequences.

Prioritize stability, modularity, meaningful gameplay, and long-term extensibility.

The ultimate goal is to make Aetheria feel like a living world rather than a static collection of game levels.

My recommendation: Make V4's defining feature the Living World System. If Aetheria can remember what happened, react to what the player does, and evolve without scripted events controlling every detail, that will be a major step forward from V3.
